<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tele-Comm Int'l started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tele-Comm Int'l started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Tele-Communications International Inc and added the stock to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Tele-Communications International gained 3/8 to 15.</p>
